<https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-structure/MICMarketCategory/value/operating> a owl:NamedIndividual, skos:Concept, fin-market-structure:MICMarketCategory;
    rdfs:comment "the MIC identifies an operating-level market infrastructure";
