<https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-structure/ScheduledTradingPhase/value/reportingOnly> a owl:NamedIndividual, skos:Concept, fin-market-structure:ScheduledTradingPhase;
    rdfs:comment "phase in which the venue accepts reports but does not operate a trading market";
